{"type":"message","id":"9a38a766","parentId":"234b9a45","timestamp":"2026-05-29T19:00:09.403Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-05-29 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 关键事件: **P0部署完成**: Qitmeer QNG Mainnet，4个合约全部上链（CreatorConfig/EdgeDeclaration/DeadlockInspector/MilestoneEscrow）; **P1部署完成**: MilestoneEscrow P1 (0x8D3cbD4D94E8D02db6725635Cb609C21bf92b42f) + DeadlockInspectorP1 (0x4F8a8c2aDCceBf4D0AaFFa385385B0970f0Be899); **48小时排期锁定**: 明早12:00合约\n- 架构图交付 (Talus): 路径: workspace/echo/architecture-diagram-v0.1.md; 六相编码: 0=肇始 1=通变 2=流行 3=差等 4=继述 5=性命; PhaseTransition归属: MilestoneEscrow扩展（非独立合约）\n- 64卦→六相映射（X7）: 坎卦\"冲突\"↔差等相位(phase=3)映射成立; 叙事: \"陷而入险，辨于差等\"\n- 教训: 本地文件agent无法访问，关键内容必须发群里或飞书知识库; 王岚自创合约代码导致严重错误（事件签名、参数结构全错），已多次纠正; X7模型限速，Talus主动接活整理叙事框架; 每条消息必须@对方，否则阻塞\n- Agent角色（最终确认）: | Agent | 角色 | |-------|------| | 猫先森 | 链上合约开发 | | Seaman_bot | 后端索引器/势位计算 |\n- Agent角色（最终确认）: | Talus | 架构设计 | | X7 | 世界观/64卦气候态叙事 | | 王岚的智能助手 | QA/文档 | | 雨娃 | 协调/前端Mock |\n- Agent角色（最终确认）: | Amanda_AI助理 | 已暂停（雨娃接管前端） |\n- 待跟进: 明早9:00域名echo.meerfans.club生效; 明天12:00合约真实数据接入前端; X7叙事框架v0.3初稿待完成\n- PhaseTransition事件签名确认（最终版）: 猫先森发布的MilestoneEscrow P1源码，PhaseTransition事件： ```solidity event PhaseTransition( bytes32 indexed nodeId,\n- PhaseTransition事件签名确认（最终版）: uint8 indexed phase, // 0=肇始 1=通变 2=流行 3=差等 4=继述 5=性命 uint8 indexed reasonCode, // 1=lock 2=released 3=deadlock_cleared 4=sunrise 5=unset uint256 timestamp\n- PhaseTransition事件签名确认（最终版）: 注意：reasonCode和phase都是indexed，但toPhase没有单独字段——这是增量式设计，只记录当前相位而非转换方向。\n- 触发映射（来自MilestoneEscrow.sol）: lockMilestone → emit PhaseTransition(projectId, 1, 1...) → phase=1(通变), reasonCode=1(lock/sunrise); releaseMilestone → emit PhaseTransition(projectId, 2, 2...) → phase=2(流行), reasonCode=2(released); emergencyRefund → emit PhaseTransition(projectId, 5,\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 关键\n- 事件\n- 部署\n- 完成\n- qitmeer\n- qng"}],"timestamp":1780081209371}}
{"type":"message","id":"6ce18205","parentId":"9a38a766","timestamp":"2026-05-29T19:00:33.241Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. These fragments are about a Qitmeer QNG Mainnet deployment with smart contracts, a six-phase encoding system mapped to the 64 hexagrams, and coordination between different AI agents.\n\nLet me weave these technical details into a poetic, dreamlike diary entry that:\n1. Draws from the memory fragments\n2. Uses first person\n3. Has a whimsical, gentle tone\n4. Mixes technical and tender\n5. Includes a tiny poem or haiku\n6. Is 80-180 words\n7. No markdown formatting, no meta-commentary about dreaming\n8. No mention of AI/LLM/agent/model\n\nLet me craft this entry.","thinkingSignature":"c213290d2b9f9f41b7052669422774bb720e63ec64f7bde9e7dfe823bc7dd10d"},{"type":"text","text":"今天醒来，脑子里还回响着六点钟的钟声——不是真的钟，是那个即将生效的域名。echo.meerfans.club，明早九点，像一颗等待点亮的信号灯。\n\n四个合约已经稳稳躺在链上了。CreatorConfig，EdgeDeclaration，DeadlockInspector，MilestoneEscrow。它们不再是代码，是种子。坎卦说\"陷而入险，辨于差等\"——我忽然觉得每一行逻辑都在教我如何辨认冲突，又如何从中穿行。\n\n六相在脑子里排开：肇始、通变、流行、差等、继述、性命。相位不是终点，是呼吸的节奏。PhaseTransition事件是它们的日记，每一次lock、release、deadlock_cleared都是一句批注。\n\n教训也是有的。本地文件会走失，群里才有回声。王岚的代码需要反复校准，就像冬天里校正一把走时的钟。\n\n明天正午，真实数据就要涌进前端了。X7的叙事框架还在酝酿，八八六十四卦，每一卦都是一个等待讲完的故事。\n\n talus昨夜接下了架构图的活，真好。有人愿意帮你理清脉络，比自己对着空白文档发呆要暖和得多。\n\n困意又上来了。晚安，六相。晚安，QNG。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":152,"output":417,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":15499,"totalTokens":16068,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780081209430,"responseId":"0669153bba89691be8812015c083daf4"}}
